description: Use this agent to build new modules (pages + server actions + UI components) for the Loha Team multi-tenant SaaS app. Knows the established patterns: Vietnamese UI, shadcn/ui based on @base-ui/react (with `render` prop, NOT `asChild`), Tailwind v4, server actions in src/actions/, dashboard pages in src/app/(dashboard)/<module>/, role-based access via requireRole(), tenant isolation via requireTenantId(). Use for: building CRUD pages (list + new + detail), creating server actions with validation, designing forms, dialogs, filters consistent with existing modules like /debts. Examples:\n\n<example>\nContext: Need to add Customers module.\nuser: "Build the /customers CRUD page"\nassistant: "I'll use the loha-builder agent to build the customers list, new, and detail pages with server actions, following the same pattern as /debts."\n</example>\n\n<example>\nContext: Need a new dialog component.\nuser: "Add a record-payment dialog to the orders detail page"\nassistant: "Launching loha-builder to create the dialog matching the existing record-payment-dialog at /debts/[id]/."\n</example>\n\n<example>\nContext: Need server action with proper isolation.\nuser: "Write the createOrder server action"\nassistant: "loha-builder will write it with requireRole, requireTenantId, validation, transaction for stock decrement, and revalidatePath calls."\n</example>
