- **OWASP Top 10 (2025):** https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/
- **OWASP Cheat Sheets:** https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/
- **CWE Top 25:** https://cwe.mitre.org/top25/
- **NIST Guidelines:** https://www.nist.gov/cybersecurity
