### Self-Hosted

On-premises deployment:

**Docker:**
```bash
docker run -d \
  -v /workspace:/workspace \
  -e ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=$API_KEY \
  anthropic/claude-code:latest
```

**Kubernetes:**
```yaml
