# Check file permissions
ls -la /path/to/mcp/server

# Make executable
chmod +x /path/to/mcp/server

# Check directory access
ls -ld /path/to/allowed/directory
```

## Performance Issues

### Slow Responses

**Check network latency:**
```bash
ping api.anthropic.com
```

**Use faster model:**
```bash
claude --model haiku "simple task"
```

**Reduce context:**
```json
{
  "maxTokens": 4096,
  "context": {
    "autoTruncate": true
  }
}
