🎯 FOUND POLLUTER!
   Test: ./test2.test.js
   Created: .git
```

### Cleanup
```bash
rm -rf /tmp/polluter-test
```

## Test Results

✅ Script logic verified (2025-11-11)
- Correctly iterates through test files
- Detects pollution creation
- Reports the polluting test file
- Exits early when polluter found

## Usage Notes

**Prerequisites:**
