## Error Handling in Queries

### onError Callback

```typescript
import { useMuiSnackbar } from '@/hooks/useMuiSnackbar';

const { showError } = useMuiSnackbar();

const { data } = useSuspenseQuery({
    queryKey: ['entity', id],
    queryFn: () => myFeatureApi.getEntity(id),

