```

## Go

**Installation:**
```bash
go get github.com/polarsource/polar-go
```

**Usage:**
```go
import (
    "github.com/polarsource/polar-go"
)

client := polar.NewClient(
    polar.WithAccessToken(os.Getenv("POLAR_ACCESS_TOKEN")),
