## Metafields

### Create Metafield

```graphql
mutation CreateMetafield($input: MetafieldInput!) {
  metafieldsSet(metafields: [$input]) {
    metafields {
      id
      namespace
      key
      value
    }
    userErrors { field message }
  }
}
```

Variables:
```json
{
  "input": {
    "ownerId": "gid://shopify/Product/123",
    "namespace": "custom",
    "key": "instructions",
    "value": "Handle with care",
