## Custom Utilities

Create reusable utility classes:

```css
@utility content-auto {
  content-visibility: auto;
}

@utility tab-* {
  tab-size: var(--tab-size-*);
}

@utility glass {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
}
```

**Usage:**
```html
