## Tailwind Utilities

**Core utility classes for layout, spacing, typography, colors, borders, and shadows.**

See: `references/tailwind-utilities.md`

Covers:
- Layout utilities (Flexbox, Grid, positioning)
- Spacing system (padding, margin, gap)
