<Link className="min-h-[44px] flex items-center px-4">Dashboard</Link>
```

### Breakpoints

```css
/* Mobile-first: style mặc định cho mobile */
.container { padding: 1rem; }

/* Desktop override */
@media (min-width: 768px) { /* Tailwind: md: */
  .container { padding: 1.5rem; }
}
```

```tsx
// Tailwind examples
<div className="px-4 md:px-6">              {/* Padding mobile vs desktop */}
<div className="hidden md:block">           {/* Ẩn trên mobile, hiện desktop */}
<div className="md:hidden">                 {/* Ẩn desktop, hiện mobile */}
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3"> {/* Responsive grid */}
```

### BottomNav vs Sidebar

