## 2. Request Flow Chuẩn

Mỗi request tới dashboard page đi qua flow sau:

```
Browser request
      |
      v
[1] NGINX
    - TLS termination
    - Proxy_pass http://nextjs:3000
      |
      v
[2] Next.js Middleware (app/middleware.ts)
    - Đọc session cookie (prefix "pkt")
    - Gọi auth.api.getSession()
    - Nếu chưa login → redirect /login
    - Nếu user.isActive = false → redirect /login?error=inactive
      |
      v
[3] Server Component (vd: app/(dashboard)/tasks/page.tsx)
    - requireAuth() → lấy user từ DB
    - Có thể requireRole() hoặc requirePermission() nếu page cần role cụ thể
    - Gọi Server Action hoặc trực tiếp query db
      |
      v
[4] Server Action (vd: actions/task.ts: getTasks())
    - requireAuth() lần 2 (không tin middleware)
    - hasPermission(user.role, "task:view:all") kiểm tra quyền
    - buildScopeFilter(user) → Prisma where clause
    - db.task.findMany({ where, include, take: 200 })
      |
      v
[5] Prisma ORM
    - Type-safe query → SQL
    - Connection pool
      |
      v
[6] PostgreSQL
    - Execute SQL, return rows
      |
      v
[7] React Server Component
    - Render HTML với data
    - Stream HTML về browser
      |
      v
[8] Browser
    - Hiển thị trang (Server-side rendered)
    - React hydration cho Client Components
```

### URL Search Params Flow (cho filtering)

```
Browser URL: /tasks?status=PENDING&range=this-week

Server Component nhận searchParams prop:
  const params = await searchParams; // { status: "PENDING", range: "this-week" }

parseDateRangeParams(params):
  → preset = "this-week"
  → range = { from: Monday, to: Sunday+1 }

Truyền vào Server Action:
  getTasks({ status: "PENDING", dateFrom: range.from, dateTo: range.to })
```

