## 9. Deployment Topology

### Production Stack

```
Internet
    |
    | HTTPS 443
    v
+------------------+
|   VPS Cloud      |  (Primary — DigitalOcean/Linode $12-20/mo)
|                  |
|  Docker Compose: |
|  +------------+  |
|  | nginx      |  |  ← Port 80/443, SSL termination, reverse proxy
|  +------------+  |
|  | nextjs     |  |  ← Port 3000 (internal), App server
|  +------------+  |
|  | postgres   |  |  ← Port 5432 (internal only), pgvector
|  +------------+  |
|  | backup     |  |  ← Cron: pg_dump mỗi ngày 2:00 AM
|  +------------+  |
|                  |
|  Volumes:        |
|  postgres_data   |  ← Database files
|  uploads         |  ← File uploads (văn bản pháp lý)
|  backups         |  ← SQL dumps (30 ngày)
|  ssl_certs       |  ← Let's Encrypt certs
+------------------+
         |
         | Replication / Manual sync
         v
+------------------+
|  Server vật lý   |  (Backup — UBND xã Trần Phú)
|  UBND nội bộ     |
|                  |
|  Same Docker     |
|  Compose stack   |  ← Replica cho data sovereignty
+------------------+
```

### Network Security

```
External network:
  Internet → nginx (80, 443) → OK
  Internet → postgres (5432) → BLOCKED (internal only)
  Internet → nextjs (3000) → BLOCKED (internal only)

Internal Docker network:
  nginx → nextjs:3000 → OK
  nextjs → postgres:5432 → OK
  backup → postgres:5432 → OK (pg_dump)
```

### Docker Compose Services

```yaml
# docker-compose.prod.yml
services:
  nginx:    # Reverse proxy + SSL
  nextjs:   # App server
  postgres: # pgvector/pgvector:pg16
  backup:   # pg_dump daily cron

networks:
  internal:  # postgres + nextjs + backup
  external:  # nginx only (exposed to internet)
```

