# Phase 05: Polish, PWA & Production Deployment

**Context:** [plan.md](./plan.md) | [phase-04-ai-legal.md](./phase-04-ai-legal.md)
**Depends on:** Tất cả Phase 01-04 hoàn chỉnh, smoke test qua

