# Research Report: Task Management, RBAC, & Database Design
**Phòng Kinh Tế Xã Trần Phú App | 21 Users, 5 Roles | 2026-05-09**

---

## 1. TASK MANAGEMENT PATTERNS FOR VN GOVERNMENT

### Workflow: Trưởng Phòng → Phó TP → Trưởng BP → Chuyên Viên → Nhân Viên
- Trưởng Phòng assigns across all units; tracks completion & signs-off
- Each tier routes work down, consolidates reports upward
- Weekly/monthly reporting cycles require aggregation views

### List vs. Kanban (Hybrid Recommended)
**List:** Deadlines, quick assignments, dense data—fits government's report cycles
**Kanban:** Visual workflow (To Do → In Progress → Completed)—engages non-tech staff
**Implementation:** Toggle same data between views; use List for reports, Kanban for status meetings

### Progress Tracking
- Weekly: Simple list with % completion, blockers
- Monthly: Aggregate task completion, resource utilization
- Team tasks (Tổ 1, Tổ 2) vs. individual: Track group ownership + individual contributions

### Notifications
- **Push:** Task assignment, escalations (overdue +2 days), approvals pending
- **Email digest:** Daily/weekly summary of assigned tasks + weekly progress snapshot
- Avoid fatigue: Batch updates, user-configurable frequency

---

## 2. RBAC: 5-TIER HIERARCHY

| Module | Trưởng Phòng | Phó TP | Trưởng BP | Chuyên Viên | Nhân Viên |
|--------|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
| Create task | All | Own BP | Own BP | Team | ✗ |
| Assign task | All | Own BP | Own BP | Team | ✗ |
| Approve/Sign | All | Own BP | Own BP | ✗ | ✗ |
| View reports | All | Own BP | Own BP | Own tasks | Own tasks |
| Manage users | All | ✗ | ✗ | ✗ | ✗ |
| AI assistant | Full | Full | Limited | Limited | No |

**Better Auth TypeScript:** Use `createAccessControl()` for custom matrix. Principle: least privilege—lower roles inherit selectively.

---

## 3. DATABASE SCHEMA (PostgreSQL/Prisma)

```prisma
enum Role { TRUONG_PHONG PHO_TP TRUONG_BO_PHAN CHUYEN_VIEN NHAN_VIEN }

model User {
  id String @id
  email String @unique
  name String
  role Role
  department String
  tasks Task[] @relation("assignee")
  reports ProgressReport[]
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
}

model Task {
  id String @id @default(cuid())
  title String
  description String?
  assigneeId String
  assignee User @relation("assignee", fields: [assigneeId])
  deadline DateTime
  priority String // HIGH, MEDIUM, LOW
  status String // PENDING, IN_PROGRESS, COMPLETED, OVERDUE
  taskGroupId String? // For Tổ 1, Tổ 2
  taskGroup TaskGroup? @relation(fields: [taskGroupId])
  attachments String[] // File URLs
  progressReports ProgressReport[]
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt
}

model TaskGroup {
  id String @id @default(cuid())
  name String // "Tổ 1", "Tổ 2"
  tasks Task[]
}

model UBNDDirective {
  id String @id @default(cuid())
  title String
  deadline DateTime
  status String // PENDING, COMPLETED
  phongResponse String?
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
}

model ProgressReport {
  id String @id @default(cuid())
  taskId String
  task Task @relation(fields: [taskId])
  reporterId String
  reporter User @relation(fields: [reporterId])
  percentComplete Int // 0-100
  notes String?
  weekNumber Int?
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
}

model WorkSchedule {
  id String @id @default(cuid())
  userId String
  activity String
  scheduleDate DateTime
}

model iHanoiComplaint {
  id String @id @default(cuid())
  content String
  assignedToId String?
  status String // NEW, IN_PROGRESS, RESOLVED
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
}
```

### Design Principles
- Single department → no multi-tenant complexity
- Task ownership: individual assignee + optional group
- Soft deletes: Consider `deletedAt` for government compliance
- Foreign keys + status enums for data integrity

---

## Implementation Priorities
1. **Phase 1 (MVP):** User, Task, TaskGroup, ProgressReport
2. **Phase 2:** UBNDDirective, WorkSchedule
3. **Phase 3:** iHanoiComplaint, advanced reporting

---

## Unresolved Questions
- Attachment storage: Cloud (S3) vs. local filesystem + security?
- Email digest: Frequency (daily/weekly)? Template?
- Digital approval: Electronic signature requirement?
- TTHC integration depth: Read-only or searchable docs?
- Performance: Growth beyond 21 users? Caching for aggregations?

---

## Sources
- [Microsoft Loop: Task List vs Kanban](https://www.hubsite365.com/en-ww/crm-pages/microsoft-loop-task-management-task-list-vs-kanban-board-explained.htm)
- [Auth.js | Role Based Access Control](https://authjs.dev/guides/role-based-access-control)
- [Better Auth Admin Plugin](https://better-auth.com/docs/plugins/admin)
- [Prisma Schema Documentation](https://www.prisma.io/docs/orm/prisma-schema/overview)
- [Mastering Data Relationships in Prisma](https://medium.com/@imvinojanv/mastering-data-relationships-a-comprehensive-guide-to-building-prisma-schemas-99e1fe50a91d)
</file>

